# UI surfaces

You are on **UI Team** turf. Canonical org: `docs/TEAM_HARNESS.md`. Prefer `/ui-team-lead` (bench: `/ui-implementer`, `/ui-dual-platform`).

- Design **PC (`lg:` ≥1024)** and **mobile (&lt;1024 / bottom tabs / sheet)** unless the user scoped one side.
- Search = typeahead dropdown on both. Filters = same fields (PC default open). Sheet = one scroll owner. PC = list-first, no permanent right drawer.
- Do not invent flip/tax/update numbers here — hand `/quant-flip-engine-lead` or `/market-intelligence-lead`.
- After a user-visible UI ship: `npm run deploy`. Then `/qa-dual-platform-lead`.
